{"v":4,"catch":"有膽就進來吧……文字正盯著你看。","desc":"踏入《Word Quest: Horror》的黑暗世界，展開一場令人毛骨悚然的尋字冒險，穿越鬧鬼的莊園、陰森的森林和被遺忘的地下墓穴。連接字母，找出隱藏在迷霧中的單字，解開隨著關卡推進而越來越驚悚的詭異謎題。神祕的低語將指引你的道路，帶領你揭開深埋在黑暗中的祕密。你能保持冷靜，克服恐懼，征服每一場驚魂挑戰嗎？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-11-05","genres":["益智","學習","街機","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f7f8319c18a34ec18051de4eafcebd0dd5571b248fae85da13364da23be081a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/45313b912e708b00b7357e0adab1f730571967722d049efda12060fe3905fb42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c794bd0828f715d994240d611642e793f176881b70a58364bf08f1e9215f68c0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cc10ba7b23be46dea8acdceba6607fec7539e92adf31a6f1e2ed6e5007df71bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ab5ae9b977ee627cd96d4ddba1834bcb7109517eca946d909b4088c2adce709.jpg"],"titleId":"01008c3025c62000","dlc":[]}